Completed one autonomous sprint.

Selected: Full-Stack MVP Sprint Sequence item 7, `US-090 Vercel Cron Month-Advance Handoff`, lane `normal`, non-UI.

Changed:
- Added bounded cron route at `app/api/cron/month-advance/route.ts`.
  - Requires `CRON_SECRET`.
  - Parses one auto class/month transition.
  - Returns scheduled-trigger-safe envelopes.
  - Dispatches valid auto requests into the shared Inngest `app/month.advance.requested` path.
- Added `executeAutoMonthAdvanceInngestHandoff` in `app/infrastructure/inngest/month-advance.ts`.
- Added unit coverage in `app/infrastructure/inngest/month-advance.test.ts`.
- Updated story/product/harness evidence:
